  "durable, visible trade goods for the upriver market": "bens comerciais duráveis e visíveis para o mercado rio acima",
  "Dust from the caravan road settles on the landing, where merchants weigh news from inland against news from the sea.": "A poeira da estrada das caravanas se deposita no cais, onde os mercadores comparam as notícias do interior com as do mar.",
